    script:
        "scripts/plot_kl.py"


# Figure 3: CSlearn (GRaSP) vs. staged-tree baselines (BOS, Backwards Hill
# Climbing). Single panel + its own legend, assembled together in one script
# instead of two separately-generated PDFs. Named for content, not for the
# input CSV's "2c" suffix -- that naming was a vestige of an older draft
# where this was one panel of a three-panel figure alongside kl_divergence_2a/2b;
# it's its own figure now, and "2c" describes nothing about the current
# structure. (The CSV itself, kl_divergence_2c.csv, keeps its existing name --
# that's the aggregation pipeline's naming, out of scope here.)
